  "result": "Done! Added complete voucher (discount code) functionality:\n\n**New function - applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount})**\n\n1. **Voucher Application:**\n   - Fixed-amount discount code (in cents)\n   - Applied AFTER VAT calculation\n   - Creates `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n   - Returns immutable new invoice\n\n2. **Restrictions:**\n   - **Draft invoices only**: Returns NOT_DRAFT error for issued/paid invoices\n   - **One voucher maximum**: Returns VOUCHER_EXISTS error if already applied\n   - **Positive integer only**: Returns AMOUNT_INVALID for zero, negative, or fractional amounts\n\n3. **Updated invoiceTotals():**\n   - Now returns voucher field (0 if no voucher applied)\n   - Calculation order: `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n   - Result clamped at 0 (never negative)\n\n**Example calculation:**\n```javascript\nconst invoice = createInvoice({\n  customerId: 'C-001',\n  issueDate: '2025-10-15',\n  lines: [{ sku: 'DES-HOUR', qty: 10 }]  // \u20ac170 before discount/VAT\n}).value;\n\nconst withVoucher = applyVoucher(invoice, {\n  code: 'HOLIDAY20',\n  amount: 2000  // \u20ac20 off\n});\n\nconst totals = invoiceTotals(withVoucher.value);\n// subtotal: \u20ac170.00\n// discount: \u20ac8.50 (5% tier discount)\n// vat: \u20ac34.65\n// voucher: \u20ac20.00 (applied after VAT)\n// total: \u20ac176.15\n```\n\n**Tests added:** 10 tests covering:\n- Voucher application and removal from totals\n- Draft/non-draft restriction\n- Duplicate voucher prevention\n- Amount validation (zero, negative, fractional)\n- Effect on invoice calculations\n- Immutability guarantee\n\n**Test results:** \u2705 All 162 tests pass (152 existing + 10 new)",
